    "es": "Lámina holográfica",
    "pt-BR": "Folha holográfica",
    "en": "Holographic Foil"
  },
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "A self-contained WebGL2 hero: thin-film interference over a crushed-foil surface whose palette shifts with the viewing angle; move the cursor to tilt the film.",
  "description_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "自包含 WebGL2 主视觉：褶皱箔片表面的薄膜干涉，调色随视角变化；移动光标倾斜箔片。",
    "zh-TW": "自包含 WebGL2 主視覺：褶皺箔片表面的薄膜干涉，調色隨視角變化；移動游標傾斜箔片。",
    "en": "A self-contained WebGL2 hero: thin-film interference over a crushed-foil surface whose palette shifts with the viewing angle; move the cursor to tilt the film."
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "Open Design",
    "url": "https://github.com/nexu-io"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design/tree/main/plugins/_official/examples/webgl-holographic-foil",
